    <l n="59" para="true">Jus novum &amp; novissimum enarratur.</l>
    <l n="60" para="true">§. 3.</l>
    <l n="61" para="true">Quomodo caveat procurator actoris?</l>
    <l n="62" para="true">§. 4.</l>
    <l n="63" para="true">Quomodo caveat reus si praesens?</l>
